\label{tab:null_fpr_methods}
\begin{tabular}{llrr}
\toprule
Method & Criterion & Rejections (/36) & FPR (\%) \\
\midrule
Diff.\ XCorr$^\dagger$ & BH-FDR & 1 & 2.8 \\
